    IsOpen W → IsOpen N' → closure W ⊆ N' → (∀ i, AnalyticOnNhd ℂ (f i) N') →
    X ∩ N' = {z | z ∈ N' ∧ ∀ i, f i z = 0} →
    (∀ z ∈ X ∩ closure W, A z ∈ B → z ∈ W) →
